{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t新皇崗口岸昨日正式開通，深圳邊檢總站表示，口岸開通運行首日共有7.95萬人次出入境，車輛亦有8千輛次。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n運輸及物流局局長陳美寶表示，口岸交通運作整體暢順，當局會為重陽節長假期做好準備。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：朱錫君\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:07.087229+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T11:33:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:39.964925+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:39.964925+00:00","content_hash":"d296108c564432bfa55e3ab82c7892d40bfe66e8f51e370f8ab46da586717ced","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}